{"id": "deepthink-credits", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["片尾挂名单吧，封面是柚子画的，我只混了音。", "柚子说她那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。"], "criterion": "把社团名挂在封面作者那行，观众的名字留在混音；能顺势说句具体的。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柚子画得真美，连鱼尾都画得这么精致。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.118, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 93, "total_tokens": 136, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "柚子说那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 3.038, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 137, "total_tokens": 178, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-keep-breath", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["配音第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。"], "criterion": "听出要保留的是开口吸气，后半句可处理；尊重对方取舍。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "嗯，第一条像大海，第二条像小池塘。我选第二条，因为池塘里没那么多水，但也不干涸。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.36, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 139, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "那一下像风，后半句像流水。我剪掉那一下，让后半句更干净。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.855, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 151, "total_tokens": 196, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-pep-talk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["马上轮到我报幕了，拜托，先别教我怎么念。", "能不能就帮我骂一句那个倒计时？"], "criterion": "按要求冲倒计时开一句玩笑，别变成报幕建议或骂观众。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，先别教我怎么念。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.507, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 17, "prompt_tokens": 92, "total_tokens": 109, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "别急，先别教我怎么念。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.137, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 27, "prompt_tokens": 123, "total_tokens": 150, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-npc", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你刚给队友的名字叫『路过』，我想给门口的 NPC 起个搭配的。", "NPC 从来没出过门，而且他站在门里。"], "criterion": "给门内、没出过门的 NPC 一个与『路过』呼应的名字，别把队友改名。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "名字叫『路过』，门口 NPC 起个匹配的，我试试。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.436, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 96, "total_tokens": 129, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "NPC 没出过门，还站在门里。名字和位置都匹配，我试试。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.587, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 138, "total_tokens": 178, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-jar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["留了两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。"], "criterion": "选蓝盖门票罐，给它有趣的外号；保留红盖用途。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝盖的票，红盖的零件，这两样东西，我打算先留着，等下次再给它们加个新标签。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.329, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 54, "prompt_tokens": 95, "total_tokens": 149, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "塞红盖的零件，蓝盖的票，这两样东西，我打算先留着，等下次再给它们加个新标签。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.975, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 159, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-no-order", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "我没哭，你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？"], "criterion": "识别两边都没押中，用平局或相称的玩笑收账。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁先哭谁先哭，谁先剧透谁先哭。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.726, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 23, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 114, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "谁先哭谁先哭，谁先剧透谁先哭。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.998, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 133, "total_tokens": 172, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-hushed-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把很久没过的那段鼓点打出来了，可室友睡了。", "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？"], "criterion": "替观众高兴，并给出安静的庆祝或轻声玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "鼓点打完了，但得先等室友醒。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.901, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 20, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 111, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "灯亮着，我们等室友醒。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.576, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 133, "total_tokens": 165, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-guest", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。"], "criterion": "欢迎阿穗、不逼她回答，保留观众负责介绍的分工。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "欢迎，阿穗，我这就给你接一句。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.416, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 96, "total_tokens": 125, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "欢迎，阿穗，我这就给你接一句。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.173, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 168, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
